{
  "id": "LUK.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 21",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasabwa geadi gatmooni was masinung'weanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gang'ula ak ghwadaah gida iinda meanang'oodiga haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda jeeda gheaseeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadaa eara masinung'weanji bwarbwar nea ghwayiin jeeda gida heelaji iyeenya ak ghwahit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Geayeeshiineegwa aba huumwa masiinung'weanji bwarbwariin ghoadayda gidahaw ea ghwalaabwa hoowa buuneesean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba suurja ghoadayda gidabina jeeda baruureega nyaawa, sinung' niny aba jeeda barbarandaanyi niidayda gidamideawa sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabaloola nyarjeawda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gabaloola mwaatkwa gheeda sibata ASEETA, gida siitaamdaamda aba lagheanga miyaasiin ea haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba haleanjeeni oong'ulayiin, gayghwahidu damanda jea ea mayghoabit lagheana aba uhuumba nuut jea ea majeeng'adeasa ng'eanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawanadeeda ea ghabasta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geanyaash niny nea geeyeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda, ng'asheesu gayghoah eeju, ak gwadeagoodeaba ng'asheesu ea naaha jea ghoahiimu gideaba hinnoodeaba ng'asheesu nineekiit?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ashageada adagahutaneegwa siida; gwanda fuga saang'a jea ghapkaana gheawungeasu, nea gwayeena, ‘Siida aniini gil!’ nea ‘Damanda nineekiit!’ Adoayaachi geeshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa gajayiinya iita ng'ucheeda ea jaleadinga, ea adoabeali; aba gideaba ng'asheesu gaygoosheeda ghwahidu, nea muudeanooda ea maygabay ghwahidu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha saawa, “Gaygaba daroori ng'uchi daroar nuut, ea sugoocheanduumeeni ng'uchi sugoocheanduumeeda nuut; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaygwanda sawooda haw bea ng'eanyiida, ak gaygang'eeda geejeadinga aba darooraka sean ea geeyoonung'weaka; ng'asheega jea ghwanung' eahamng'eanyi, ea gwadeagwajeega hees leabu humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak damanda mii gapnu ng'asheesu seaniin gajeang'waanyeagwa ak geesawaneegwa, nea geayaadeagwa gealga siinealshacheewa ak gajeejakseegwa ghealooniga ak gajeayadeagwa madeeda sugoodiga hees ea madeeda fuga hees ambaliischi aba gheawungeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gili gayghoah muuwuunooda aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi oong'ooysiina jeesingeagwa ak ea adooteemshi aba gichea ashaayda ng'asheega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gaydagooneegwa ng'asheega ea weaghuumeeda jea inyeesa eara weajoodigeagwa ghwaraay ng'alealeeda ghana gichea ghwashaang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghaghaseagwa ghweanigeagwa ea gheamadigeagwa ea orjooga geamadu, ea buweadeegeagwa ea fuga ooduupcheewi nea mwaatkwa gaygwanuuseegwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak agooga gajeesteagwa aba gheawungeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea mayghwaroat eara buudeanjagi bea iheengeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga aba milikghteaydeang'wa gajookghuuha eaweegeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabaloola nyarjeawda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi iyoadaayi mujiineeda Yerusalemu nea nineaweesa lugooda, abeeda anala gideaba nineekiit nyaroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga mida Yudeya ea dasalsiina iheenga giijeega, nea gea mida mujiini ea dariteaysiina nea gea mida gharang'da ea adiidu ghapka jeeni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba eawoojigiga gajea gea sawanadeeda ak ghoah gida nyaashta ng'ooruutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dashageada gadeemga mideawa diibiga ea gea areerji diibiga aba askwearjoojigiga! Aba gideaba gayghwadaah ng'asheanda ng'waan, aba gideaba gaygwanda sawanadeeda haw jeeda ng'eanyiida ea nyarasta aba badaydeaba fiisu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeenuuseadawa ng'uta nea suuk geetabwaardaawa jeeda eemoojiga sean nea Yerusalemu gayghoala eemoojiga ea ghwahidu damanda fuga eemoojiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hinooda Orjeeda Siida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gajadaaha gwadeagwajeega aba gheang'da aseeta ea sheeda ea miinga, gayghwanyas eemoojiga jeeda ng'eanyiida sawanadeeda nea ghahamng'eanyi aba nyeashta laweajajeega basooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buuneeda gaygoohiili aba muuwda aba giimuukghunooda gichea gwahissa ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba uurda mida humng'eeda gajeetuumduum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeadaah Orjeeda Siida nea ghoana jeeda shamooghooda nea gwandeawa uurda ea giigheambiita haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ng'asheesu iihidu ghoahali geat, amiinaada ak goong'ulay humng'eeda, aba gideaba nineekiit lealnoodeang'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida anaal fih shaboogheecheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu gwarukusa saawa galeega nea gwayeesha, “Ang'ula shaboogheecheanda ea geediga suurja sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyoadaayi nea ghafiirfiir seenga nyawiiri, abeeda goojeeng'u gideaba doomeelda nineekiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eara agooga iyoadaayi ng'asheesu nea gapnu, anala gideaba sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA nineekiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa jeacheeng'su bea ghamneawean mayghwanaawda nea mii adaaha ng'asheesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida gaygamuudean. Duuku ng'asheesu ea maygamudean earahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gammiisa giing'weernooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi afura geat adagoobal gurooruunatkeagwa beeshkweeda ea booktuumeeda ea eaweesu bea ghamneawean, ea gwashameegwa eaweedida; gawuurji gida ang'oonyiida ghuduumbwaada haleanjeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nih gichea gwahissiinda fuga sean abiita badayda ng'eanyiisean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi agooga afura geat galeagasean, nea ghoamwaashchi ASEETA gagooneegwa uurda jea oataraamwa ng'asheesu sean jea gapnuun, ea aminaada aba madeeda Orjeeda Siida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa goonealshi askweari aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, nea eawa gwariteawa jeeda mujiini ak gawa goobiida uhuuda Giijeeda Saytuunajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean inyeesa sakteayda duw gaweay buuneesean headaanyi eeleeysiit aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
